   "cooked": "<p>Please take a look at our current correlation assumptions that are going into the cadCAD simulator for the hatch. Would anyone like to initialize surveys, Le Grande Jeu, or other ways to evaluate  and expand these assumptions?</p>\n<p>Kudos to <span class=\"mention\">@Vitor</span> for making the dataset, and to <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/randomshinichi\">@randomshinichi</a> for raising  the concerns on modeling assumptions!</p>\n<p>What if matrix:<br/>\n</p><aside class=\"onebox googledocs\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1W6O4eSsqX9EbtZvRyQY94iyTP3HkVvUozCa_qVKZsg4/edit#gid=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">docs.google.com</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1W6O4eSsqX9EbtZvRyQY94iyTP3HkVvUozCa_qVKZsg4/edit#gid=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"googledocs-onebox-logo g-sheets-logo\"></span></a>\n<h3><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1W6O4eSsqX9EbtZvRyQY94iyTP3HkVvUozCa_qVKZsg4/edit#gid=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">What-if matrix Commons Simulator</a></h3>\n<p>What-if matrix\n\n\nWhat-if question,Description of experiment,Type of experiment,Variables / parameters,Values / ranges to be tested,Experiment results\nWhat if scenario x occurred?,By doing y, test whether z causes x.,Monte Carlo,α,[1.0, 2.0,...</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>",
